  "id": "noxious-stimulus",
  "term": "noxious stimulus",
  "definition": "A noxious stimulus is an input that is experienced as harmful or painful. In this context, stronger noxious stimulation is linked to broader brain activity and greater involvement of higher-order processes such as attention, response preparation, and cognitive control.",
